## ⚖ Rules Lawyer
Query: "Rules query: "Isolation penalties and their effects" (from rules/gameplay.md)"


The isolation penalties and their effects can be found in the 'Encounter Rules' section of the rulebook. Here is the relevant excerpt:

* Isolated: When a character is isolated from other characters, they take a -1 penalty to rolls.
* Very Isolated: If a character is very isolated, they take a -2 penalty to rolls.
* Extremely Isolated: If a character is extremely isolated, they take a -3 penalty to rolls.

